      "id": "2123431084419338353",
      "author_id": "1542707718",
      "text": "Get your sheep ready, as this month includes a new Armour Insert using Wool. 🐏☢️🧶\n\nIt offers a small buff to melee and projectile protection, plus a large buff to cold resistance, making those chilly Arctic nights more survivable. You'll find it on the Tier 1 tech tree.\n\nRead more on our DevBlog: https://t.co/MF9kei76SG",
      "url": "https://x.com/playrust/status/2123431084419338353",
      "expanded_urls": [
        "https://rust.facepunch.com/news/printed_and_polished"
